    },
    {
      "_id": "1U7HISACpDa1HeKR",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!YCxHPFDwwk4QiaET.1U7HISACpDa1HeKR",
      "name": "Storyteller Notes",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>By custom, the lower levels are neutral ground outside Elysium: the place where favors are called in and paid off without witnesses from the court.</p>\n<p>It&#39;s useful for meetings with @UUID[JournalEntry.WHkwE8CYfaKW5WyO]{Rosa Iturbe}, with @UUID[JournalEntry.dj4gIszHHTN1QRKk]{Thornquist} outside his domain, or with @UUID[JournalEntry.oQ2AhEeDkwdPRv71]{O'Connor} if he comes into the city.</p>\n<p>It doesn&#39;t appear in any fixed scene; it&#39;s a wild card for the Storyteller.</p>\n"
      },
